title Three tracks, and a token that was not legal
prompt Keaton -- kg in your best recommended order and feel free to parallelize
think Split by file rather than by topic, which is what makes parallel agents safe here: two agents writing two files nobody else touches cannot conflict, so the one-writer law is kept without a lock.
think Sent one agent to single-strand twelve moonshots onto a design page and one to seat the tally-infuse spell, and took the eight lessons myself -- the largest write, and the one whose register judgement I did not want to delegate.
obs THE DOORWAY GUARD CAUGHT ME. Every lesson carried Room: teaching, which reads sensible and is not one of the four tokens the law allows. The guard refused the commit and printed the legal set. Repaired accurately rather than uniformly: two checkable, one vision, six mixed, because the pocket devices, the kernel beneath Aurora and the platform above Brushstroke are drawn rather than built.
obs THE INDEX GRADED 59 AND WAS RIGHT. Truth read zero because it linked eight lessons and one existed. That is references-are-promises measured rather than recited, and it climbed to 95 the moment the eight landed. A low grade that resolves itself by doing the work is the best kind.
obs A git add -A swept both agents' files into my lessons commit, whose body named neither. Amended before pushing so all three tracks are described -- nothing left undescribed is the rule, and a mixed commit with a single-track message breaks it quietly.
obs The spell agent found the sharpest thing of the round without being asked: the word Mycelium covers a running consensus module of about 100 Rye files AND a proposed .myc contract language with zero tracked files. One word, two referents, which is exactly the braid the spell exists to refuse.
loom lessons=8 composite_low=95 composite_high=97 index_before=59 index_after=95
loom agents=2 moonshots_composite=96 spell_composite=94 conflicts=0
rota lap 4553, row 3 -- Water, the row that tastes: read up close and run the actual thing. What it surfaced: grading each page one at a time is what found the index at 59 while every lesson beside it read 95 or better.
file docs-geode/lessons/README.md the index, and eight walks linked from it
file docs-geode/lessons/20260910-060225_lesson-1-the-house-from-above.md through lesson 8, each naming its own room
file active-designing/20260910-060204_the-bounded-torus-moonshots.md twelve single-stranded rows, wrap-as-bound ranked first
file spellbook/20260910-060416_tally-infuse.md seven strands, each with its ceiling
scope one teaching room opened, twelve moonshots single-stranded, one spell seated, three tracks in parallel
status GREEN on living-docs lint and the pin bounds; every page graded before landing; the doorway guard satisfied by repair rather than by exemption
recommend kg -- the moonshot page ranks its own first witness, a Rye ring buffer whose wrap is asserted, and that is the smallest thing here that touches metal
